   "title": "Note: How AiLabor Art Studio uses this",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Text + reference images\n\nAiLabor Art Studio generates and edits pictures with this file (Settings -> Generator).\n\n- **Text to image**: the reference sockets stay empty; nothing extra is added.\n- **Edit / references**: the app uploads the picture(s) to ComfyUI and wires them to **reference_1 ... reference_N** on a temporary copy of this graph, so the file itself never changes.\n\nDefaults: 40 steps, euler / simple, CFG 1, 1024 x 1024. Each reference costs extra time and VRAM."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Text + reference images\n\nAiLabor Art Studio generates and edits pictures with this file (Settings -> Generator).\n\n- **Text to image**: the reference sockets stay empty; nothing extra is added.\n- **Edit / references**: the app uploads the picture(s) to ComfyUI and wires them to **reference_1 ... reference_N** on a temporary copy of this graph, so the file itself never changes.\n\nDefaults: 40 steps, euler / simple, CFG 1, 1024 x 1024. Each reference costs extra time and VRAM."
